      "text_raw": "The distortion is also mea-\nsured by means of a\nspectrum analyzer. An ex-\nample is shown in this slide\nfor a fundamental frequency\nof 30 MHz. The second har-\nmonic is set at 60 MHz and\nthe third one at 90 MHz.\nNote however, that the\ncomponents are now given,\nnot the ratios of HD and\n2\nHD . Increasing the funda-\n3\nmental component by 1 dB\nwill raise the second-order\nby 2 dB and the third-order\nby 3 dB.",
